IMAPAccount mail-archive
Host {{ .mail_archive_imap_host | quote }}
Port {{ .mail_archive_imap_port }}
User {{ .mail_archive_imap_user | quote }}
TLSType IMAPS
AuthMechs PLAIN

IMAPStore mail-archive-remote
Account mail-archive

MaildirStore mail-archive-local
Path {{ printf "%s/maildir/" .mail_archive_directory | quote }}
Inbox {{ printf "%s/maildir/INBOX/" .mail_archive_directory | quote }}
SubFolders Verbatim

Channel mail-archive
Far :mail-archive-remote:
Near :mail-archive-local:
Patterns INBOX *
Sync PullNew PullOld
Create Near
Remove None
Expunge None
CopyArrivalDate yes
SyncState *
